        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "被役使者看到的是古制最沉重的一面。卡拉霍斯称之为秩序的东西，常意味着别人的锁链、鞭痕与没有选择的劳作。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
